#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:7
msgid "User Guide"
msgstr "用户指南"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:10
msgid "Understand graph execution"
msgstr "理解图执行"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:13
msgid ""
"The canvas is an editor for a typed experiment document; the backend "
"executes the serialized dependencies, not pixels or visual proximity."
msgstr "画布是有类型实验文档的编辑器；后端执行的是序列化的依赖关系，而不是像素或视觉邻近性。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:17
msgid "From canvas to request"
msgstr "从画布到请求"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:19
msgid ""
"A graph document contains nodes, edges, and viewport state. Each node has a "
"type, identifier, position, and data fields. Each edge identifies its "
"source, target, source handle, and target handle."
msgstr "图文档包含 Nodes、边和视口状态。每个 Node 都有类型、标识符、位置和数据字段。每条边标明其源、目标、源 handle 和目标 handle。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:23
msgid ""
"When a Trainer starts, the frontend serializes the execution graph rooted in"
" that Trainer. The backend validates required inputs and resolves the "
"connected dataset, model, optimizer, loss, schedules, and Observables before"
" allocating the run."
msgstr ""
"Trainer 启动时，前端会序列化以该 Trainer 为根的执行图。后端在分配运行前验证必需输入，并解析已连接的数据集、模型、优化器、损失、调度器和"
" Observables。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:28
msgid "Training and measurement are separate"
msgstr "训练与测量相互分离"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:30
msgid ""
"The primary loss participates in backpropagation. Observables read permitted"
" training state at log points. Connecting an Observable does not add it to "
"the loss, although computing it can make the run slower."
msgstr "主损失参与反向传播。Observables 在记录点读取允许的训练状态。连接 Observable 不会将它加入损失，但计算它可能使运行变慢。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:34
msgid "The Trainer returns distinct logical outputs:"
msgstr "Trainer 返回彼此独立的逻辑输出："

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:36
msgid "a model checkpoint for downstream checkpoint consumers;"
msgstr "供下游检查点消费者使用的模型检查点；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:37
msgid "loss and test histories for Training viz;"
msgstr "供 Training viz 使用的损失和测试历史；"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:38
msgid "named Observable histories for their paired visualizations."
msgstr "供配套可视化使用的具名 Observable 历史。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:40
msgid ""
"That separation makes it possible to change a measurement without silently "
"changing the objective."
msgstr "这种分离使得可以改变测量，而不会悄然改变目标。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:43
msgid "State has more than one lifetime"
msgstr "状态具有多种生命周期"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:45
msgid ""
"Node settings and graph structure belong to the graph document. Workspace "
"organization belongs to the workspace snapshot. Result histories and model "
"bytes are runtime state that may be removed by a smaller save tier. Remote "
"credentials live outside the graph under `.comfyresearch/`."
msgstr ""
"Node 设置和图结构属于图文档。工作区组织属于工作区快照。结果历史和模型字节是运行时状态，较小的保存层级可能会移除它们。远程凭据位于图之外的 "
"`.comfyresearch/` 下。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:50
msgid ""
"Therefore, a visible canvas is not automatically a complete reproducibility "
"bundle. Choose a save tier and external method record that match the claim."
msgstr "因此，可见画布并不自动构成完整的可复现性包。请选择与结论相匹配的保存层级和外部方法记录。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:53
msgid "Events are incremental"
msgstr "事件是增量式的"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:55
msgid ""
"Training is streamed as newline-delimited JSON. Progress arrives before a "
"terminal completed, paused, aborted, or error outcome. The frontend commits "
"histories and checkpoint state back into the graph only as those events are "
"handled."
msgstr "训练以换行分隔的 JSON 流式传输。进度事件先于最终的完成、暂停、中止或错误结果到达。前端仅在处理这些事件时才将历史和检查点状态写回图中。"

#: ../../en/user-guide/execution-model.md:60
msgid ""
"See [Training API](../reference/training-api.md) for the supported route and"
" event contracts."
msgstr "支持的路由和事件契约请参阅[训练 API](../reference/training-api.md)。"
